  "analytic": {
    "query_differs": "Open CASCADE's IntCurvesFace_ShapeIntersector reports a ray through an edge once per face that meets there and one through a vertex once per face at it; Arris reports one hit naming the edge or the vertex (ADR-0053 \u00a71), so the oracle's hits of one t are merged before the comparison"
